    "review_slideshow_VYnrEb": {
      "type": "review-slideshow",
      "blocks": {
        "image_VrhFeb": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/review-pic-3.jpg",
            "text": "<p>I love this and use it on trips all the time; I’ll just run it back and forth on my face while I doom scroll on Instagram. And it really has made a difference in the jowl area.<\/p>",
            "customer_name": "- Mindy Kaling",
            "sub_text": "American Actress, Screenwriter, and Producer"
          }
        },
        "image_JpjTPk": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/review-pic-1.png",
            "text": "<p>Despite having over 25 years of professional experience as a skin practitioner, I use MyoLift QT myself and never travel without it. The device is genius—compact, lightweight, and incredibly easy to use.<\/p>",
            "customer_name": "- Dr. Meder",
            "sub_text": ""
          }
        },
        "image_tJ9GL4": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Review-pic-4.png",
            "text": "<p>The Microcurrent, especially Myo lift is so exciting because the results really are incredible. And I tell every client, no matter if you're 25or 85, you will see a difference in your skin. And that difference will be cumulative. Microcurrent machine, it is an investment that you're making into your business.<\/p>",
            "customer_name": "- Joanna Vargas",
            "sub_text": ""
          }
        },
        "image_zcEa3a": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Review-pic-5.png",
            "text": "<p>This beauty tool is a game changer for firming and toning your skin. Just glide it across your face in upward motions for a few minutes a day to stimulate and contour. It’s like a mini face workout that leaves you glowing and lifted.<\/p>",
            "customer_name": "- Sarah Akram",
            "sub_text": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "image_VrhFeb",
        "image_JpjTPk",
        "image_tJ9GL4",
        "image_zcEa3a"
      ],
