          "type": "liquid",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "code": "<center><h1> Microcurrent Face Lift Before and After  <br>Reviews and Results!<\/h1>\n<p>Does a non-surgical facelift work? This is the question most people who are curious about devices for face lifting may come across. The answer is yes and the best part is that it requires zero downtime.<\/p>\n<p>Due to their non-invasive nature, microcurrent face-lifting devices have a remarkable ability to show results without the need for any downtime.<\/p>",
